PROJECT CONTEXT
===============

package            : soundpost
study handle       : EARLST (early-postoperative recurrence, latent survival token)
domain             : hepatobiliary oncologic imaging - survival-aware recurrence
                     prediction from five-phase Gd-EOB-DTPA MRI of the post-resection
                     remnant liver
framework          : PyTorch (hand-rolled selective state-space / Mamba blocks, no
                     mamba-ssm dependency); pydantic v2 config schemas; Click CLI;
                     plain YAML on disk
venue family       : Scientific Reports style single-column manuscript
compute target     : not reported in manuscript; upper-bound profile fixed in
                     configs/experiment/main.yaml (8x A100-80GB, fp32, effective
                     batch 256, lr 2e-5, 800 epochs, 10 seeds)
hparams reference  : Implementation and training paragraph (K=8 RST queries, T=12
                     two-month bins, two-layer FiLM MLP, ten-seed averaging,
                     prospective AUROC 0.91 +/- 0.008 worst 0.898, C-index
                     0.81 +/- 0.008 worst 0.794)

DATA LAYERS
-----------
Primary (private, restricted, NOT redistributable): EOB-RECUR, 3200 patients, four
sites, three vendors, three regions. Carries the only curative-resection 24-month
recurrence endpoint. Available upon reasonable request to the contributing
institutions; cannot be downloaded.

Auxiliary public (encoder pretraining + external context only; verified live):
  LiTS         CC BY-NC-ND 4.0   competitions.codalab.org/competitions/17094
  ATLAS        CC BY-NC-SA       atlas-challenge.u-bourgogne.fr
  LLD-MMRI     research use      github.com/LMMMEng/LLD-MMRI-Dataset
  CHAOS        CC BY-SA          zenodo.org/records/3431873  (10.5281/zenodo.3362844)
  HCC-TACE-Seg TCIA DUA          cancerimagingarchive.net/collection/hcc-tace-seg
  TCGA-LIHC    TCIA DUA          cancerimagingarchive.net/collection/tcga-lihc
None of the public sets provide the curative-resection recurrence label.

